<metadata><name>Lake Murray Endurance Run 100 Mile (2026)</name>
<desc>Unofficial. Built from the race's 2024 course map (blazetrails.com/lake-murray-course) traced onto OpenStreetMap trails, with elevation from the USGS 10 m model. South loop to Tucker Tower and back, then the north loop round Elephant Rock, three times, then a last south loop. Map data (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL.</desc></metadata>
